  "description": "HackCOSMIC is the flagship hackathon of CONFLUENCE - IEEE DAY 2026 , organized by the IEEE Student Branch at VIPS-TC, Delhi . Event Date: 17-10-2026 Get ready for an 8-hour high-intensity hackathon where student developers, innovators, and creators come together to build, experiment, and solve real-world problems. 8 Hours of Non-Stop Building Exciting Cash Prizes Goodies & Swag for Participants Food & Refreshments Throughout the Hackathon Prizes & Recognition for Winning Teams Certificates & Participation Recognition An energetic, competitive hackathon environment Whether you're a seasoned developer or participating in your first hackathon, HackCOSMIC is your opportunity to turn ideas into working solutions, compete with talented builders, and showcase what you can create in just 8 hours. Build. Compete. Innovate. Conquer HackCOSMIC. THEMES: AI for Real-World Impact - AI solutions addressing problems in society, education, healthcare, governance, accessibility, etc. Cybersecurity & Digital Trust - Privacy, secure systems, identity, fraud prevention, misinformation, digital safety. ClimateTech & Sustainable Innovation- Climate resilience, energy efficiency, carbon reduction, water, waste, sustainable agriculture. Human × AI — The Next Generation- AI as a collaborator in education, productivity, creativity, accessibility, research and decision-making. FinTech- Financial accessibility, fraud detection, personal finance, digital payments, credit, financial literacy. HealthTech & Wellbeing Preventive healthcare, accessibility, health monitoring, medical workflows, mental wellbeing . Agriculture & Farming- Precision agriculture, farmer assistance, supply chains, food wastage, climate-resilient farming. Open Innovation — Build Beyond Boundaries An intentionally broad theme where teams identify a meaningful problem and build a technology-driven solution. WhatsApp Group: https://chat.whatsapp.com/CuvZ9Li5cY51sRvOw37HeX?s=sw&p=i&mlu=0&ilr=4",
