    "details": "<p><strong>HackCOSMIC</strong> is the flagship hackathon of <strong>CONFLUENCE - IEEE DAY 2026</strong>, organized by the <strong>IEEE Student Branch at VIPS-TC, Delhi</strong>.<br /><strong>Event Date: 17-10-2026</strong></p>\n<p>Get ready for an <strong>8-hour high-intensity hackathon</strong> where student developers, innovators, and creators come together to build, experiment, and solve real-world problems.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>8 Hours of Non-Stop Building</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Exciting Cash Prizes</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Goodies &amp; Swag for Participants</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Food &amp; Refreshments Throughout the Hackathon</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Prizes &amp; Recognition for Winning Teams</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Certificates &amp; Participation Recognition</strong></li>\n<li><strong>An energetic, competitive hackathon environment</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Whether you're a seasoned developer or participating in your first hackathon, HackCOSMIC is your opportunity to <strong>turn ideas into working solutions, compete with talented builders, and showcase what you can create in just 8 hours.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Build. Compete. Innovate. Conquer HackCOSMIC.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>THEMES:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>AI for Real-World Impact -</strong>AI solutions addressing problems in society, education, healthcare, governance, accessibility, etc.</li>\n<li><strong>Cybersecurity &amp; Digital Trust -</strong>Privacy, secure systems, identity, fraud prevention, misinformation, digital safety.</li>\n<li><strong>ClimateTech &amp; Sustainable Innovation-</strong>Climate resilience, energy efficiency, carbon reduction, water, waste, sustainable agriculture.</li>\n<li><strong>Human &times; AI &mdash; The Next Generation- </strong>AI as a collaborator in education, productivity, creativity, accessibility, research and decision-making.<strong> </strong></li>\n<li><strong>FinTech-</strong>Financial accessibility, fraud detection, personal finance, digital payments, credit, financial literacy.<strong> HealthTech &amp; Wellbeing<br /></strong>Preventive healthcare, accessibility, health monitoring, medical workflows, mental wellbeing<strong>.<br /></strong></li>\n<li><strong>Agriculture &amp; Farming-</strong>Precision agriculture, farmer assistance, supply chains, food wastage, climate-resilient farming. <br /><strong>Open Innovation &mdash; </strong>Build Beyond Boundaries An intentionally broad theme where teams identify a meaningful problem and build a technology-driven solution.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>WhatsApp Group:</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/CuvZ9Li5cY51sRvOw37HeX?s=sw&amp;p=i&amp;mlu=0&amp;ilr=4</span></p>",
